Rejected claims
Displays all the claims that are in a rejected state.

Screenshots	Info

From top to bottom, left and right:
- Title: rejected value of title
- 0.000,00 EUR: rejected value of totalAmounts.value and totalAmounts.symbol
- 24/02/2026: rejected value of claimDateTimeOffset in format DD/MM/YYYY
- Rejected: rejected from status and indicated the status of the claim.

Tapping a rejected claim navigates the user to the claim detail screen.
Draft claims
Displays all the claims that are in the draft state.

Screenshots	Info

From top to bottom, left and right:
- Title: returned value of title
- 0.000,00 EUR: returned value of totalAmounts.value and totalAmounts.symbol
- 24/02/2026: returned value of claimDateTimeOffset in format DD/MM/YYYY
- Draft: returned from status and indicated the status of the claim

Tapping a draft claim navigates the user to the details of the claim.
Unassigned expenses
Displays all expenses that are not yet assigned to a claim.




